WEBVTT

00:00:57.912 --> 00:01:01.621
and made groundbreaking discoveries about
how primates behave and communicate.

00:01:02.287 --> 00:01:05.413
It turns out that we have a lot more in
common with apes than we realize.

00:01:05.913 --> 00:01:08.121
And by observing their actions
and interactions,

00:01:08.413 --> 00:01:10.538
I think we can learn a
lot about leadership,

00:01:10.538 --> 00:01:12.788
status and culture among humans.

00:01:15.913 --> 00:01:19.079
I'm Adam Grant and this is taken
for granted by podcast with

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.413
the TED Audio Collective. I'm an
organizational psychologist.

00:01:22.871 --> 00:01:26.496
My job is to think again about
how we work, lead and live.

00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:29.829
So I guess the place to start
is can you tell me

00:01:29.829 --> 00:01:31.913
a little bit about where
you are right now